    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d657-a1">

                <pb facs="0662" n="546" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg546"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Legation to the Department of Foreign
                        Relations</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Port au Prince</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-12-24">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">December 24, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The American Legation in pursuance of instructions just received, has the honor
                    to inform the Department of Foreign Relations that the Government of the United
                    States hopes that the foreclosure proceedings against the National Railroad of
                    Haiti will be suspended until such time as all questions pending between the
                    Haitian Government and the railroad can be considered at Washington.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
